    "body": "Let $T: \\mathbb{R}^2 \\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}^3$ be the linear transformation for which \n\\[T\\left(\\left[\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\ 1 \\end{array}\\right]\\right)=\\left[\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{array}\\right] \\quad \\textrm{and} \\quad T\\left(\\left[\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\ 2 \\end{array}\\right]\\right)=\\left[\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{array}\\right]\\]\n\n(1) Let $A$ be the standard matrix of $T$, find $A$.\n\n(2) Find the image of the vector $\\mathbf{u} = \\left[\\begin{array}{c}1 \\\\ 3\\end{array}\\right]$.\n\n(3) Is the vector $\\mathbf{b} = \\left[\\begin{array}{c}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{array}\\right]$ in the range of $T$? If so, find all of the vectors $\\mathbf{x}$ in $\\mathbb{R}^2$ such that $T(\\mathbf{x}) = \\mathbf{b}$.",
